# Not inputs to `next build`. Keeping them out of the build context means an
# edit to the mobile shell, docs or tests doesn't bust the `COPY . .` layer
# cache, and local native build output (android/ alone can be ~90 MB) isn't
# uploaded to the builder (#518). None of this changes the runtime image.
